  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would really love if we could set a specific avatar's impostor as our main fallback that appears regardless of what avatar is currently active.\n\nIn a lot of cases, using an impostor is way more convenient and sometimes even produces a better-looking result than making a custom global fallback, so I'd like to just choose one avatar's impostor to be displayed when impostors aren't available for other avatars I'm using.\n\nI understand how this suggestion could become pointless when impostors are eventually generated automatically for all avatars, but I thought I'd ask for it anyway as there still could be use-cases for it in that context. Like desktop-only non-humanoid avatars that can't be impostorized, for example.",
